[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13200.95, "timestamp": "03:40:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.99, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13221.95, "timestamp": "03:40:21", "text": "一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13229.15, "timestamp": "03:40:29", "text": "跑步真让人满足"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13237.429, "timestamp": "03:40:37", "text": "我不明白他什么时候是，什么时候是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13240.15, "timestamp": "03:40:40", "text": "那该怎么办？哦，你只是躲起来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13242.389, "timestamp": "03:40:42", "text": "在墙后。就这么离开他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13244.63, "timestamp": "03:40:44", "text": "当你看到这种情况时，视线就会受到影响。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13246.79, "timestamp": "03:40:46", "text": "知道他是怎么杀你的，或者类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13249.67, "timestamp": "03:40:49", "text": "我觉得它像是出故障了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13258.349, "timestamp": "03:40:58", "text": "好的。"}]